      "description": "Watch Fiorentina vs Frosinone highlights and goals from Serie A on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. The tension was palpable in the Serie A encounter held on August 29, 2026, as both sides looked to make their mark on the campaign. It was a high-stakes fixture that demanded discipline and tactical precision from the opening whistle. Early exchanges and clinical finishing The match ignited early when Frosinone took control. In the 26th minute, Antonio Raimondo found the back of the net with a left-footed strike following a well-placed pass from Giorgi Kvernadze . Fiorentina nearly responded in spectacular fashion during the 35th minute when both Franco Mastantuono and Victor Valdepenas struck the woodwork in a frantic sequence that could have easily changed the complexion of the game. However, Frosinone held their nerve, and in the 38th minute, Gabriele Bracaglia rose to head home a Giacomo Calo corner, doubling the lead just before the break. Second half management As the game moved into the second half, Fiorentina pushed to find a way back, but defensive solidity from the visitors kept them at bay. The contest was effectively put to bed in the 68th minute when Antonio Raimondo netted his second of the match after a key pass from Romano Schmid . While the hosts continued to fight, with Rolando Mandragora forcing a save from Lorenzo Palmisani late on, Frosinone maintained their defensive shape to see out a hard-fought and deserved victory."
